# Den of the Bugbear is played as the first land, so it enters untapped. On turn 3 Bot1 pays {3}{R} with four Moxen and
# animates it: until end of turn a 3/2 red Goblin land creature (CR 613.1d, 613.4b) with the attack trigger. Attacking
# makes a 1/1 red Goblin token tapped and attacking (CR 508.4): Bot2 takes 3 + 1. On turn 4 the effect is gone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Den of the Bugbear
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
